# The build context is the repository root: send only this directory, and the two files of each release database that
# the catalog build reads: its schema (for the sample rows) and its column meanings. The knowledge base, part of which
# each task hides, and the ground truth, in data/*.jsonl, stay out.
*
!benchmarks/bird_interact/auto_ontology/
!benchmarks/bird_interact/data/*/databases/*/*_schema.txt
!benchmarks/bird_interact/data/*/databases/*/*_column_meaning_base.json
